HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The aaiioo facility appeared as a kernel option in FreeBSD 3.0.  The aaiioo
     kernel module appeared in FreeBSD 5.0.  The aaiioo facility was integrated
     into all kernels in FreeBSD 11.0.

